{"id":"sagwallah","lines":[{"t":0.17,"end":0.55,"chars":[0],"who":"Kandidat","text":"Yo, what's up?","de":"Ja, was geht?","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":0.55,"end":1.77,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"Hey, what's up?","de":"Hey, was geht?","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":1.77,"end":2.87,"chars":[0],"who":"Kandidat","text":"What's up, Jalla?","de":"Was geht, Jalla?","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":2.87,"end":4.2,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"Oh. Hello.","de":"Oh. Hallo.","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":4.2,"end":4.71,"chars":[0],"who":"Kandidat","text":"Yeah?","de":"Ja?","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":4.71,"end":6.24,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"So, welcome. You're a contestant.","de":"So, willkommen. Du bist Kandidat.","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":6.24,"end":8.44,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"If we win the round, you get 100 euros.","de":"Gewinnen wir die Runde, bekommst du 100 Euro.","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":8.44,"end":9.57,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"Say \"Wallah\"?","de":"Sag \"Walla\"?","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":9.57,"end":11.05,"chars":[0],"who":"Kandidat","text":"Nah.","de":"Nee.","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":11.05,"end":11.47,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"Ah, okay.","de":"Ah, okay.","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/10.mp3"},{"t":11.47,"end":14.11,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"Okay. You taking the challenge?","de":"Okay. Nimmst du die Herausforderung an?","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/11.mp3"},{"t":14.11,"end":15.44,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"Hey, cool. How old are you?","de":"Hey, cool. Wie alt bist du?","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/12.mp3"},{"t":15.44,"end":17.87,"chars":[0],"who":"Kandidat","text":"Hm, 13.","de":"Hm, 13.","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/13.mp3"},{"t":17.87,"end":18.79,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"Hm, that took you a pretty long time to think about.","de":"Hm, das hast du aber ganz schön lange überlegt.","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/14.mp3"},{"t":18.79,"end":22.45,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"Okay. Alright, 13. I'm 13 too. Funny.","de":"Okay. Alles klar, 13. Ich bin auch 13. Witzig.","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/15.mp3"},{"t":22.45,"end":23.45,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"Wallah\"?","de":"Walla\"?","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/16.mp3"},{"t":23.45,"end":24.39,"chars":[0],"who":"Kandidat","text":"Okay.","de":"Okay.","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/17.mp3"},{"t":24.39,"end":25.22,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"Okay, good.","de":"Okay, gut.","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/18.mp3"},{"t":25.22,"end":28.44,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"You've already said \"Wallah\" three times in three sentences.","de":"Du hast jetzt schon drei Mal \"Walla\" gesagt in drei Sätzen.","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/19.mp3"},{"t":28.44,"end":29.38,"chars":[0],"who":"Kandidat","text":"No, two.","de":"Nein, zwei.","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/20.mp3"},{"t":29.38,"end":30.56,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"What does that mean?","de":"Was heißt das?","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/21.mp3"},{"t":30.56,"end":30.92,"chars":[0],"who":"Kandidat","text":"What?","de":"Was?","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/22.mp3"},{"t":30.92,"end":32.52,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"What does \"Wallah\" mean?","de":"Was heißt \"Walla\"?","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/23.mp3"},{"t":32.52,"end":35.4,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"Your pants are wet.","de":"Deine Hose ist nass.","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/24.mp3"},{"t":35.4,"end":37.52,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"Wallah\" means... Did you do it?","de":"Walla\" heißt... Hast du es gemacht?","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/25.mp3"},{"t":37.52,"end":38.61,"chars":[0],"who":"Kandidat","text":"Yes.","de":"Ja.","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/26.mp3"},{"t":38.61,"end":39.44,"chars":[0],"who":"Kandidat","text":"Yes.","de":"Ja.","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/27.mp3"},{"t":39.44,"end":40.98,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"That's what it means? Okay.","de":"Das heißt das? Okay.","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/28.mp3"},{"t":40.98,"end":42.14,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"Hm.","de":"Hm.","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/29.mp3"},{"t":42.14,"end":42.502,"chars":[1],"who":"Trymacs","text":"Alright.","de":"Alright.","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/30.mp3"},{"t":42.502,"end":42.762,"chars":[0],"who":"Kandidat","text":"Yes.","de":"Ja.","orig":"scenes/sagwallah/lines/31.mp3"}]}